        "Shelley v. Kraemer, 334 U.S. 1 (1948), Justia, https://supreme.justia.com/cases/federal/us/334/1/",
        "Shelley v. Kraemer, Wikipedia (vote 6-0, recusals, Vinson), https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shelley_v._Kraemer",
        "Hansberry v. Lee, 311 U.S. 32 (1940), Justia, https://supreme.justia.com/cases/federal/us/311/32/",
